# Skip-list for evaluator corpus tests (TestEvaluatorCorpus). Format:
#
#   <phase> <path>[: reason]
#
# - <phase>: eval
# - path relative to internal/integrationtest/testdata/evaluator/
# - lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored
#
# Entries are skipped before .expected is consulted, so listed fixtures
# do not need a sibling .expected file. Once the gap closes: drop the
# entry, mint .expected via scripts/eval-corpus-oracle, fixture becomes
# regression coverage.

# --- gaps/ ------------------------------------------------------------
# One fixture per known evaluator gap. Reasons reference the offending
# evaluator/object source location where the gap currently lives.

